OL,3,ABritish chess prodigy, 11, becomes
OL,4,Ayoungest woman grandmaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the latest milestone in a
OL,7,Fremarkable rise for the schoolgirl, who
OL,8,Fhas already become Britain's youngest
OL,9,Fwomen's chess champion and the youngest
OL,10,Fperson to represent England
OL,11,Finternationally in any sport.
